100	
101	    // GPRs x1..x31 + DPC: one abstract register write each (DATA0/DATA1 +
102	    // Access-Register COMMAND), abstract-only by design. x0 is hardwired zero
103	    // and is skipped. M-mode CSRs, PMP and V land in later commits; M-mode
104	    // CSRs/PMP are pass-through-merged at drain time, never programmed through
